{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJdhNfhw5Mk8sDK4CoB3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is the env-var key normalization change in `InitializationFilter`: a `NON_NORMALIZED_KEYS` whitelist that keeps the underscores in credential variables such as `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME`, which the old code turned into dotted keys. I could not find the commit SHA or PR that introduced it. `TRUNK-6646` returns no hits in `openmrs-core`, and my tools don't include commit history. The only in-repo reference is the test's javadoc, which calls it \"the fix for env-var key normalization that was dropping create_database_* and create_user_* credentials in scripted setup.\"\n\n**The bug:** every environment variable went through `normalizeEnvVariableKey`, which lowercases the key and turns every `_` into `.`. So `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME` became `create.database.username`. The lookup then asked for `create_database_username`, found nothing, and the wizard fell back to the defaults (root, no password).\n\n**The fix:**\n- `NON_NORMALIZED_KEYS` lists the variables that must keep their underscores, including `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME`, `CREATE_DATABASE_PASSWORD`, `CREATE_USER_USERNAME` and `CREATE_USER_PASSWORD` (`openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:197-201`).\n- `normalizeEnvVariableKey` returns those keys lowercased without the dot conversion. Every other key still gets the underscore-to-dot conversion (`InitializationFilter.java:1948-1953`).\n- The env vars are merged into the script properties here (`InitializationFilter.java:340-343`), and the wizard then reads `create_database_username` and `create_database_password` (`InitializationFilter.java:370-373`).\n\n**Tests:** `InitializationFilterNormalizationTest` checks the key mapping, and `InitializationFilterTest` checks that the env vars reach the wizard model.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 1948, \"endLine\": 1953},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 197, \"endLine\": 201},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 334, \"endLine\": 345},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 370, \"endLine\": 373},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java\", \"startLine\": 18, \"endLine\": 82},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java\", \"startLine\": 163, \"endLine\": 189},\n  {\"ticket\": \"TRUNK-6646\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2068,"cache_read_input_tokens":27389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2068},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e7f28fb7-254f-4507-b711-463d001f6f6c","uuid":"f63b2d89-37d2-4579-aace-488a05a92ce3","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:41:21.683Z","request_id":"req_011CgJdhNN6QmRix1vYtjJ61"}
